Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:19:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Show password age badge in vault items list

Login items in the vault (and organization vault) list now show a badge
with the age of their password, using the passwordAge pipe. The badge
turns into a warning once the password is older than a threshold that
can be set on the Options page (365 days by default, kept in local
storage alongside the other display preferences).

Items whose password was never changed have no password revision date,
so their age falls back to the item's revision date.
